sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Client as Enterprise API Client
  participant Compiler as Grapheme Compiler
  participant Store as Artifact Registry
  participant Stasis as Stasis Command Layer
  participant Queue as Stasis Job Queue
  participant Worker as Grapheme Worker Adapter
  participant Runtime as Grapheme Runtime
  participant Locus as STTP Store

  Client->>Compiler: Submit .aql source and target entrypoint
  Compiler->>Compiler: Parse, lower, verify, capability checks
  Compiler->>Store: Publish artifact envelope and MIR payload
  Client->>Stasis: Enqueue execution job with artifact ref and input STTP id
  Stasis->>Queue: Persist enqueued job
  Queue->>Worker: Lease due job attempt
  Worker->>Store: Resolve artifact envelope
  Worker->>Locus: Resolve input STTP context
  Worker->>Runtime: Execute artifact under capability scope
  Runtime-->>Worker: Execution result and trace summary
  Worker->>Locus: Persist output STTP node
  Worker->>Queue: Mark succeeded or retryable failure
  Worker->>Stasis: Emit outbox event for downstream orchestration
